+/* Zelda of Warcraft - the four companions.
+ *
+ *   Lyra Ashford    human priest      shy but curious; her road runs through the churches of the
+ *                                     Eastern Kingdoms to Lady Katrana Prestor, Onyxia and Nefarian
+ *   Faelin Swiftbreeze  night elf hunter  restless and high-energy; she follows whispers of the
+ *                                     Old Gods from Darkshore to the gates of Ahn'Qiraj
+ *   Durza Stormcaller   orc shaman        fierce, quick to anger and quick to cry; the angry fire
+ *                                     spirits lead her from Durotar to Ragnaros
+ *   Vesper Duskhollow   undead warlock    soft-spoken, dry and gothic; she hunts the Scourge from
+ *                                     the graves of Brill to Naxxramas
+ *   Elara Starfall      human mage        cheerful, bookish and a little too sure of her fireballs;
+ *                                     she roams Elwynn, Westfall, Redridge and Duskwood on her own
+ *                                     (level 25), fighting whatever gets in her way
+ *
+ * Each girl has a spawn per chapter of her story (creature 1901xx-1904xx); zelda_stage decides which
+ * one a hero can see, so she seems to travel and level on her own. Ask her to travel with you and a
+ * copy of her follows you everywhere - into dungeons too - fighting and healing at your level, and
+ * she is friendly to Alliance and Horde alike. Quests live in the world database (zelda-sql).
